  "The animation below follows one worked example: a 3210 × 2250 plate of 6 mm glass, a 15 mm trim on all four edges, a 3 mm blade gap, and five pieces to come out of it.",
  "The answers below are limited to what the application actually implements.",
  "The application can seed a single complete demonstration workflow into an empty database — one enquiry, one quotation, one job order, one partial delivery, one tax invoice. These are its numbers, read straight out of the seeder rather than chosen for a page.",
  "The application compares editions by order, not by name, so a stored licence keeps its meaning as new tiers are appended. The descriptions below are the definitions written on the edition enum itself.",
  "The application is a single WPF solution: views and view-models split one folder per business area, one database context per bounded context, and a design system the entire interface is drawn from. Localisation is resource dictionaries, so a new language does not need a code change.",
  "The application is a single WPF solution: views and view-models split one folder per business area, one database context per bounded context, and a design system the whole interface is built from. The same discipline shows in the numbers on this page — no debt markers in shipped code, policed by a test rather than by good intentions.",
  "The application is the argument. A demonstration will take you through the chain on a job you recognise.",
  "The application log and the audit trail — what it did, and who changed what.",
  "The application log and the audit trail, side by side.",
  "The application log answers \"what did it do\" — startup, licence checks, seeding, production events, failures — and a log file is a diagnostic artefact. The audit trail answers \"who changed this, and when\", record by record, with the before and after of every field. Keeping them apart is why the log can be rolled and truncated without losing the record of who approved a quotation.",
  "The application seeds this job itself.",
  "The application ships four visual families and sixteen accent presets, all chosen from Settings. The card edge, the corner it turns on and the tint of the fill are set beside them. The same controls drive this website: press a plate below, or move the edge, and the page you are reading re-themes itself.",
  "The application ships the same idea in Settings → Appearance. For the full set — sixteen colour plates,",
  "The application stores documents, not summaries. A quotation becomes a job order becomes a delivery becomes an invoice — and each step keeps the audit record of the one before it.",
  "The application's Crystal Fluid family: see-through surfaces over a luminous environment.",
  "the application's default",
  "The application's own default — FontService.DefaultFontFamily.",
  "The application's strict default family — crisp sky over slate, minimal tinting.",
  "The approved proforma is what the job order is converted from.",
  "The assistant inside the application reads across the same records — stock, documents, activity, profitability, statements and analytics. It is deliberately read-heavy: there is exactly one write it can perform, and it is permission-gated, confirmed and audited.",
