  "The eighteen section names are constants, and the file says why: grouping and filtering depend on them, and a free-typed name would quietly create a second \"Proforma Invoice\" that no filter would ever show. System Center then groups those sections into five scopes — all activity, transactions, inventory, system, users and security — over the same trail.",
